WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.334
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:03.836
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're all doing well.

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.571
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.571 --> 00:00:08.274
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis
announced yesterday

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:10.743
that he was suspending
his presidential campaign.

00:00:10.743 --> 00:00:13.913
And this only a few days
after Iowa announced it.

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:16.683
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:19.352
After DeSantis suspended
his presidential campaign

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.154
and endorsed
former President Trump,

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:23.122
Trump said that he will retire
the nickname

00:00:23.122 --> 00:00:24.424
Ron DeSanctimonious.

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:26.559
Added Trump,
"If I kept using it,

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:28.394
that would be very unfair
to my good friend

00:00:28.394 --> 00:00:29.529
Meatball Ron."

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:32.031
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.031 --> 00:00:34.534
President Biden's campaign
released a new ad yesterday

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:35.868
blaming former President Trump

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:37.437
for overturning
Roe versus Wade,

00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:39.738
prompting an immediate response
from the Trump campaign --

00:00:39.738 --> 00:00:41.574
"Can we use this too?"

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:44.177
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:46.212
President Biden last week
canceled

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.113
$5 billion
in student loan debt.

00:00:48.113 --> 00:00:49.582
"Wow, it's my lucky day,"

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:51.150
said the NYU grad.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:54.220
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.488
That's right.

00:00:55.488 --> 00:00:58.691
President Biden canceled
$5 billion in student loan debt.

00:00:58.691 --> 00:00:59.959
Or if you go to UMass,

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:01.628
whatever that is in
Marlboro Miles.

00:01:01.628 --> 00:01:03.095
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.095 --> 00:01:07.700
Look, we have a writer from
Massachusetts who writes these.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:10.236
We have an on-staff
"Masshole"...

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:12.105
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:13.439
...named Mike Scollins,
whose respon--

00:01:13.439 --> 00:01:15.841
We have -- Look,
we have a writer from Arizona.

00:01:15.841 --> 00:01:18.044
We have one from Florida,
so a lot of that's inbound.

00:01:18.044 --> 00:01:20.280
We have one of the heirs
to the Arby's fortune.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:23.016
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:24.918
We have a Spirit Airlines pilot.

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:26.386
A lot of the stuff we do...

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:28.687
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.687 --> 00:01:30.823
After presidential candidate
Nikki Haley

00:01:30.823 --> 00:01:33.192
questioned his mental fitness,
former President Trump

00:01:33.192 --> 00:01:35.762
defended his abilities
at a rally on Saturday

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:38.331
and said he recently
aced a cognitive test.

00:01:38.331 --> 00:01:40.767
Said Trump, "I found
all the motorcycles."

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:44.404
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:45.671
[ As Trump ]
"And I did good too,

00:01:45.671 --> 00:01:47.307
because
they gave me a second set.

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:50.109
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.109 --> 00:01:52.278
I made it to level two
of motorcycles.

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:54.614
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:56.315
They were like, 'Whoa,
this is never hap--

00:01:56.315 --> 00:01:59.018
You got all the motorcycles.'

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:02.555
Sometimes I wondered. It was
just part of a motorcycle."

00:02:02.555 --> 00:02:04.557
In a recent sermon,
Pope Francis warned

00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:06.092
that pornography brings

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:08.761
"satisfaction
without relationship."

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:11.731
That story again,
the Pope is bad at warnings.

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:13.366
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:15.301
Your warning
against pornography

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:18.538
shouldn't sound like
the tagline for a porn site.

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:22.442
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.442 --> 00:02:24.577
The makers of Kraft Singles
have announced

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:26.412
that they will launch
three new flavors

00:02:26.412 --> 00:02:28.081
for the first time
in nearly 10 years,

00:02:28.081 --> 00:02:29.916
and hopefully
one of them is cheese.

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:32.251
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.251 --> 00:02:35.555
Officials in an Italian province
recently announced

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:37.423
the new plan to use DNA
to track down

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:39.091
and find dog owners
who don't pick up

00:02:39.091 --> 00:02:40.226
their pet's droppings.

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:41.561
And, this is cool,
it also helped them

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:43.363
finally catch the Zodiac Killer.

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:45.899
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.969
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:52.505
Are you more bummed
'cause it's a dog?

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:54.774
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.774 --> 00:02:57.476 line:0%
The sandwich chain Subway
has announced

00:02:57.476 --> 00:03:00.512 line:0%
that it will offer
footlong Auntie Anne's pretzels

00:03:00.512 --> 00:03:01.981 line:0%
and Cinnabon churros.

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:03.515 line:0%
It's never a good sign
for your restaurant

00:03:03.515 --> 00:03:07.320 line:0%
when your best idea is "what if
we sold someone else's food?"

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.656 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.656 --> 00:03:11.324 line:0%
And finally,
officials in New Jersey

00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:14.093
recently discovered that a gas
station was selling a gas --

00:03:14.093 --> 00:03:15.961
was selling gas -- excuse me --

00:03:15.961 --> 00:03:18.263
that was nearly 60% water,

00:03:18.263 --> 00:03:20.933
which is especially shocking
because in Jersey,

00:03:20.933 --> 00:03:23.102
not even the water
is 60% water.

00:03:23.102 --> 00:03:24.503
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.503 --> 00:03:26.940
We do not -- We do not have
any Jersey writers on staff.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:28.875
That was -- The entire crew!

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:30.977
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.977 --> 00:03:32.077
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:03:32.077 --> 00:03:32.912
We're off and running.

